    "terminal": "2041 has all product revenue categories +3%, stable product and Foundry profit ratios, D&A20% Products and net investment \u0394external revenue/.60 including WC10%\u0394revenue. Repeat3% nominal scaling thereafter. No capex=DA with free growth and no additional g/ROIC charge."
