    "no_free_subsidy": "Root absolute new AMIC eligible basis remains12/14/12/8/5/2B for2027\u20132032; no automatic credit for incremental bullish capital. Existing receivable collections3/3/2B2027\u20132029 also unchanged.",
    "no_free_outside_capital": "No incremental customer deposit, partner capital, new share issuance or external14A award is added to fund this path. Lease/NCI and claims remain root-owned and charged once.",
