  "strongest_objection": "Substrate and advanced-packaging availability may remain the bottleneck despite better wafer output; CPU unit growth and premium mix may also fail to coexist as ARM/custom competition expands. This countercase needs accepted and paid finished products, not merely more wafer starts, and it needs Foundry profit improvement after rising depreciation and continuing14A R&D. It cannot be validated from management TAM alone.",
